        <mxCell id="t1" value="&lt;b&gt;Level-1 설명 평가 시스템 아키텍처&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;가격변동 설명: 개연성 + 사례정합을 v1으로 먼저 구축 → 판별력(v2) · 일반화(v3) 기획" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="8" width="1000" height="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg" value="청색 = v1 (지금 구축) · 보라 = v2 (기획) · 녹색 = v3 (기획)&#xa;적색 = 모든 버전 공유 바닥 · 점선 = 기획/공유 흐름" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="8" width="400" height="48" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="L0" value="입력 · 계약  (Inputs &amp; Contracts — Phase 0 고정)" style="swimlane;startSize=34;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="64" width="1420" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ep" value="&lt;b&gt;Evidence Packet&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;관찰구간 · 기준시각(asof) · 가격/분해 수치&#xa;원문증거(발행시각 · 출처) · content_hash&#xa;allowed_evidence_refs" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="L0">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="48" width="320" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cc" value="&lt;b&gt;Candidate Card&lt;/b&gt;  (평가 대상)&#xa;claims[] · counterpoints[] · data_gaps[]&#xa;ticker_decisions[] · proposed_state_transition&#xa;주장종류: OBSERVED / ESTIMATED / HYPOTHESIS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="L0">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="48" width="320" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sg" value="&lt;b&gt;Scorer Gold&lt;/b&gt;  (SEALED · 채점자 전용)&#xa;필수 / 허용 / 금지 주장 · 기대 상태&#xa;★NEW: 메커니즘 · 2-leg 분해 정답 (개연성 gold)&#xa;후보 입력과 물리 분리" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="L0">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="48" width="330" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="corpus" value="&lt;b&gt;Case Corpus&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;노출: public / dev / sealed&#xa;층: 8 strata (동시경쟁 · 재보도 · 시점위반 · 결측 · 상태갱신 · 분해불일치 …)&#xa;2인 독립주석 + 조정 판정" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="L0">
          <mxGeometry x="1050" y="48" width="350" height="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="L1" value="공통 스파인 · 하드 게이트  (Shared Spine · 비상쇄 바닥 — 모든 버전 공유)" style="swimlane;startSize=34;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="274" width="1420" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fw" value="&lt;b&gt;PIT Firewall&lt;/b&gt;  · firewall.py&#xa;τ 시점고정: asof 이후 자료 차단 (전 자산)&#xa;content_hash 검증 · scorer-gold 물리 분리&#xa;위반 시 RUN_INVALID" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="L1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="48" width="430" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hg" value="&lt;b&gt;Hard Gates (6, 비상쇄)&lt;/b&gt;  · validator.run_hard_gates&#xa;FORMAT · PIT · EVIDENCE · FABRICATION · FORBIDDEN_LANGUAGE · STATE_DIVERGENCE&#xa;하나라도 걸리면 즉시 실패 — 유창성 · 비용 · 평균으로 상쇄 불가&#xa;→ 확신 작화 · 시점위반을 v1부터 차단" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="L1">
          <mxGeometry x="490" y="48" width="650" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;왜 바닥이 공유인가&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;level-1을 단독 점수로 쓰지 않게 하는 장치. 게이트 + 대비 + risk-coverage 가 확신 작화를 벌하고 보류를 상준다." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="L1">
          <mxGeometry x="1160" y="50" width="240" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="L2" value="v1 — Level-1 채점: 개연성 + 사례정합    ▶ 지금 구축" style="swimlane;startSize=34;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="464" width="1420" height="315" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s_fit" value="&lt;b&gt;사례정합 Scorer&lt;/b&gt; (case-fit) · metrics.py [reuse]&#xa;· required_claim_recall (필수주장 재현)&#xa;· false_gap_precision (거짓공백 정밀)&#xa;· evidence_fidelity (근거 연결 충실)&#xa;· 분해 일치 (DECOMPOSITION_MISMATCH)&#xa;· 상태 정확성" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="L2">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="48" width="450" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s_plaus" value="&lt;b&gt;개연성 Scorer&lt;/b&gt; (plausibility)  ★NEW&#xa;· 생성성: 2-leg 반사실 (시장 vs 잔차) 존재 + 부호&#xa;· 경로성: 원인 → 신호 → 가격 메커니즘 링크&#xa;· 조건부 적절성: 방향 · 크기밴드 정합&#xa;정답: Scorer Gold 의 메커니즘 · 분해" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="L2">
          <mxGeometry x="495" y="48" width="470" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="contrast" value="&lt;b&gt;반-굿하트 대비시험&lt;/b&gt; · contrast.py [reuse]&#xa;MUST_CHANGE / MUST_NOT_CHANGE × 7 변이&#xa;(시점교환 · 근거제거 · 재보도추가 · 경쟁근거 · 공백유혹 · 상태오염 · 인용훼손)&#xa;개연성 · 사례정합의 게임화 차단" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="L2">
          <mxGeometry x="985" y="48" width="405" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="agg" value="&lt;b&gt;집계&lt;/b&gt; · metrics / reporting.py&#xa;risk-coverage (보정된 보류) · 0.6:0.4 보조손실 · 층별 / 거시 평균" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="L2">
          <mxGeometry x="230" y="220" width="560" height="80" as="geometry" />
